# Stage-4 ledger (instrument only, no behaviour change): one line per AbstractBlockPackedWriter construction with the length of blockValues,
# and one line per SAICodecUtils.checkBlockSize call with its three arguments. Output on stdout (node started with `bin/cassandra -f`).
RULE stage4 block-packed writer constructed
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.index.sai.disk.v1.bitpack.AbstractBlockPackedWriter
METHOD <init>
AT EXIT
IF TRUE
DO traceln("BPW " + $0.blockValues.length + " " + Thread.currentThread().getName())
ENDRULE

RULE stage4 checkBlockSize called
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.index.sai.disk.v1.SAICodecUtils
METHOD checkBlockSize
AT ENTRY
IF TRUE
DO traceln("CHK " + $1 + " " + $2 + " " + $3)
ENDRULE
